    "body": "**Description:**\r\nidentity-anonymization-tool should be able to replace the user information in \"MESSAGE_\" field in ACT_HI_COMMENT table.\r\n\r\nFor example: if we provide the capability to replace the user information in the ACT_HI_COMMENT, it should support the user information maintained in the comments as well.\r\n\r\n![screenshot from 2018-03-13 18-52-46](https://user-images.githubusercontent.com/14962228/37344207-c33b4e3a-26ef-11e8-8f65-5b718ac72d27.png)\r\n\r\n\r\n",
